## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues:

**ECS tasks not starting**
```bash
aws ecs describe-tasks \
  --cluster $CLUSTER_NAME \
  --tasks $(aws ecs list-tasks --cluster $CLUSTER_NAME --query taskArns --output text) \
  --region $AWS_REGION
```

**RDS connection issues**
```bash
# Check security groups allow Fargate→RDS traffic
aws ec2 describe-security-groups --group-ids $SG_FARGATE --region $AWS_REGION
aws ec2 describe-security-groups --group-ids $SG_RDS --region $AWS_REGION
```

**Ollama unreachable**
```bash
# SSH into Ollama EC2 and check service
ssh -i ~/.ssh/rag-ollama-key.pem ubuntu@$INSTANCE_IP
sudo systemctl status ollama
curl http://localhost:11434/api/version
```

**Logs not appearing in CloudWatch**
```bash
# Verify task execution role has CloudWatch permissions
aws iam get-role-policy --role-name rag-ecs-task-role --policy-name cloudwatch-logs
```
